                <head>No. 10.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram at 9 a. m., <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-12">February 12,
                        1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">M. le Chargé d’Affaires des Etats Unis, à Paris:</hi></p>
                <p>The Niagara has arrived at Corunna. The Stonewall at Ferrol commencing repairs.
                    The Sacramento at Lisbon making repairs. Your telegram not official has been
                    received.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
